  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#processing-the-type-attribute says the type attribute should be parsed like the `Content-Type` header but doesn't define how to parse it exactly.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/html/semantics/document-metadata/the-link-element/link-type-attribute.html tests this attribute but doesn't cover things like whitespace around valid values, and edge-cases...",
